Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: xwayland-satellite
Suggests: foot | kitty, swaylock, swayidle, wlopm
Description: quiet tiled Wayland compositor and desktop shell
 Tessa is a wlroots-based tiled Wayland compositor written in Zig. It includes
 its own taskbar, launcher, wallpaper, per-output workspaces, compositor-level
 IME relay, XWayland integration, session locking, idle/output-power support,
 declarative window and workspace rules, and a process-based extension API.
